msgid ""
"Usage Tips\n"
"\n"
"Select:\n"
"Highlight text (or a word) in the book, then press [AI assistant] in the poped up menu.\n"
"\n"
"Long Press:\n"
"- On a Prompt Button: Add to the highlight menu.\n"
"- On a highlight menu button to remove it.\n"
"- On the Close button to go back to the book in 1 step.\n"
"\n"
"Very-Long Press (over 3 seconds):\n"
"On a single word in the book to show the highlight menu (instead of the dictionary).\n"
"\n"
"Multi-Swipe (e.g., %1, %2, %3):\n"
"On the result dialog to close (as the Close button is far to reach).\n"
msgstr ""
"Foydalanish bo'yicha maslahatlar\n"
"\n"
"Tanlash:\n"
"Kitobdagi matnni (yoki so'zni) ajratib oling, so'ng qalqib chiquvchi menyuda [AI yordamchi] tugmasini bosing.\n"
"\n"
"Uzoq bosish:\n"
"- Prompt tugmasida: Ajratish menyusiga qo'shish.\n"
"- Ajratish menyusi tugmasida uni olib tashlash uchun.\n"
"- Yopish tugmasida kitobga bir qadamda qaytish uchun.\n"
"\n"
"Juda uzoq bosish (3 soniyadan ortiq):\n"
"Kitobdagi bitta so'zni juda uzoq bosib, lug'at o'rniga ajratish menyusini ko'rsatish.\n"
"\n"
"Ko'p surish (masalan, %1, %2, %3):\n"
"Natija muloqot oynasida yopish uchun (Yopish tugmasi uzoqda bo'lgani uchun).\n"

